Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.36,0:00:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Tsuda!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.15,0:00:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Thanks for stepping in the other day. \NYour support kept the project on track.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.41,0:00:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry for all the trouble I caused you!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.25,0:00:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Ito,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.71,0:00:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}we're on the same team. \NOf course I've got your back.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.33,0:00:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.21,0:00:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather hear a simple "thank you."
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.38,0:00:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsuda!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.01,0:00:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.68,0:00:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much! Thank you! Thank...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.39,0:00:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Do you have a moment \Nto discuss tomorrow's presentation?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.35,0:00:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.73,0:00:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So, as for features we can add to the language area...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.61,0:00:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I work for a major electronics manufacturer,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.32,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}in the planning department for AI household robots,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.90,0:00:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}which keeps me busy every day.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.70,0:00:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that's it for me for today.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.70,0:00:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so great about virtual reality?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.75,0:01:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Sure, the section lead said \Nthat AI wasn't going to take my job.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.88,0:01:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But he can't know that for sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.30,0:01:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}What if I {\i1}do{\i0} lose my job to a hot new AI \Nand wind up unemployed?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.72,0:01:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I might die alone in this filthy pit.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.35,0:01:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hire myself a pretty little maid!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.35,0:01:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All-purpose maid robot? Nope! Maid cafe? Nope!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.35,0:01:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, they left something this big unattended?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.35,0:01:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oof, this is heavy!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.40,0:01:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I should've opened the door first! Darn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.70,0:01:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.20,0:01:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, it's time to wake up.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.45,0:01:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.41,0:01:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you sleep well last night?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.37,0:01:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Where'd you come from?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.34,0:01:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,From the cardboard box in the doorway.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.71,0:01:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That enormous box!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.67,0:01:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I buy an actual human girl?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.13,0:01:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.64,0:01:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, my charging port is on the back of my neck.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.68,0:02:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a gynoid designed for sexual use.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.39,0:02:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Nadeshiko.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.60,0:02:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds shady! This {\i1}has{\i0} to be illegal!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.15,0:02:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm gonna get arrested, sentenced, and fired...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.73,0:02:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.74,0:02:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,First, just touch me as I give you the user tutorial.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.24,0:02:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so soft.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.66,0:02:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I was built with the "idealized human form" in mind,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.79,0:02:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,equipped with finely tuned pressure sensors
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.04,0:02:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,that respond to even the faintest stimula—
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.79,0:02:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You felt that?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.84,0:02:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.50,0:02:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\i1}Not even my company \Nhas humanoid robots this elaborate.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.13,0:02:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.85,0:02:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that come from?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.22,0:02:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You were staring at my lips, \Nso I thought you wanted a kiss.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.52,0:02:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.48,0:02:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it unsatisfactory?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.69,0:02:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I am certain that my oral cavity's specs are fine, so...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.11,0:02:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How about my genitalia?{alt: "entry port" to be more like the previous "oral cavity"?}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.74,0:02:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's downright incredible.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.57,0:03:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If you insert your finger, \NI can officially register you as my master.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.99,0:03:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.66,0:03:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Then you're a bottom, Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.33,0:03:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take everything I say as horny!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.38,0:03:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.71,0:03:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We can conduct the registration another time.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.38,0:03:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Lastly, we'll perform \Na direct demonstration of my body.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.14,0:03:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax and leave everything to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.68,0:03:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Where are you putting that finger?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.14,0:03:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.27,0:03:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you I'll guide you to ecstasy.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.44,0:03:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My tongue and fingertips have multiple sensors
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.32,0:03:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,capable of detecting your erogenous zones.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.20,0:03:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there's one.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.08,0:03:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Also, I compile detailed \Nreports during sexual activity,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.75,0:03:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}so that the quality of our sexual \Nexperience will improve with each session.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.54,0:03:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So does that mean
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.96,0:03:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}this girl is going to have a record
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.97,0:03:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}of all my most embarrassing spots?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.10,0:04:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I just activated my finger's vibrate function.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.40,0:04:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}By smoothly modulating the strength \Nand direction of the vibration,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.86,0:04:13.52,Alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I've never done this before,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.52,0:04:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,we can maximize your pleasure.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.52,0:04:15.61,Alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}but it feels so good!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.61,0:04:17.53,Alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I can't stop! Oh no...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.24,0:04:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing you had the day off from work.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.21,0:04:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.92,0:04:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to tend to you all day long, Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.46,0:04:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think my life might be over.
